om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/68ec2a4bcadc3eae91fbfe5ae561b93e.avif?t=1749507426\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no maps. No hints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have is each other\u2019s mind \u2014 and your voices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget: the only way out is by working together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/0047db52c01f31704528d045a9806bb6.poster.avif?t=1749507426\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/0047db52c01f31704528d045a9806bb6.webm?t=1749507426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/0047db52c01f31704528d045a9806bb6.mp4?t=1749507426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
